{"id":"the-vastwood-forest","name":"The Vastwood Forest","type":"location","aliases":["the Vastwood","Vastwood"],"description":"The forest where Nissa keeps vigil.","pages":3,"first_seen":"2015-08-12","last_seen":"2015-09-23","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Nissa's Quest","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-09-23","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nissas-quest-2015-09-23","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nissas-quest-2015-09-23","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Nissa's Quest\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 23 Sep 2015."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e0","summary":"Nissa and Ashaya watch from a ridge over the Vastwood Forest, looking at the white corruption left by Ulamog's brood.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","ulamog"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"minor","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":6,"quote":"The Eldrazi drained the life and essence from all the living things they encountered.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=The%20Eldrazi%20drained%20the,living%20things%20they%20encountered.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=The%20Eldrazi%20drained%20the,living%20things%20they%20encountered.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e1","summary":"Nissa names the elemental Ashaya, the Awoken World, after Hamadi's name for her.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","hamadi"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":23,"quote":"\"Okay then, Ashaya it is,\" Nissa said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22Okay%20then%2C%20Ashaya%20it%20is%2C%22%20Nissa%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22Okay%20then%2C%20Ashaya%20it%20is%2C%22%20Nissa%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e2","summary":"Nissa questions why Zendikar chose her again after she failed the first time, and Ashaya repeats its confusing gesture.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"minor","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"I failed. Last time you chose me, I failed.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=I%20failed.%20Last%20time,chose%20me%2C%20I%20failed.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=I%20failed.%20Last%20time,chose%20me%2C%20I%20faile