12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=the%20Eldrazi%20consumed%20the,pale%20body%20into%20dust.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e5","summary":"A vampire consoles Nissa, reveals he knows her name and her spark, and tells her the world is ending.","participants":["the-vampire-envoy","nissa-revane","anowon"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":97,"quote":"\"That is fair considering your history with vampires, Nissa.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22That%20is%20fair%20considering,history%20with%20vampires%2C%20Nissa.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22That%20is%20fair%20considering,history%20with%20vampires%2C%20Nissa.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e6","summary":"The vampire offers four seeds from Anowon, including the last bloodbriar of Bala Ged, asking Nissa to take them to another plane.","participants":["the-vampire-envoy","nissa-revane","anowon","bala-ged"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":113,"quote":"\"Kolya, red mangrove, jaddi, bloodbriar.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22Kolya%2C%20red%20mangrove%2C%20jaddi%2C%20bloodbriar.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=%22Kolya%2C%20red%20mangrove%2C%20jaddi%2C%20bloodbriar.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e7","summary":"Nissa takes the seeds as the vampire argues no effort can beat the titans; Ashaya watches, and the vampire vanishes.","participants":["nissa-revane","the-vampire-envoy","ashaya"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":135,"quote":"She took the seeds.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=She%20took%20the%20seeds.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=She%20took%20the%20seeds.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e8","summary":"Mimicking Ashaya's gesture, Nissa sees glowing leylines stream from her fingers and understands Zendikar did not choose her but she is one with it.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","leylines","zen