 and Ashaya kill the one-tentacled Eldrazi with a spear of land and a punch from Ashaya.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","eldrazi"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"minor","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":182,"quote":"The horror let out a final deflating chitter as it collapsed.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=The%20horror%20let%20out,chitter%20as%20it%20collapsed.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=The%20horror%20let%20out,chitter%20as%20it%20collapsed.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"For Zendikar\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"zendikar-2015-08-12-e11","summary":"Nissa rides Ashaya and calls an army of baloth-sized elementals as they hunt an Eldrazi titan.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/zendikar-2015-08-12","order":243,"story_date":"2015-08-12","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":190,"quote":"an army of baloth-sized elementals took shape.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=an%20army%20of%20baloth%2Dsized%20elementals%20took%20shape.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"For Zendikar","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/zendikar-2015-08-12#:~:text=an%20ar