official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Silent Cry","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=%22We%20have%20to%20give,help%20we%20can%20give%2C%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Silent Cry\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"silent-cry-2015-08-26-e5","summary":"Nissa and Ashaya arrive too late at the thicket, where the Eldrazi has killed all but two heart trees, and then kill it.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","eldrazi","the-heart-trees"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/silent-cry-2015-08-26","order":245,"story_date":"2015-08-26","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":107,"quote":"The monster was both killed and buried in the same stroke.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=The%20monster%20was%20both,in%20the%20same%20stroke.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Silent Cry","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=The%20monster%20was%20both,in%20the%20same%20stroke.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Silent Cry\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"silent-cry-2015-08-26-e6","summary":"Nissa and Ashaya promise the last heart tree that Zendikar will fight on, and they press on in pursuit of the titan.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","the-heart-trees"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"minor","page":"stories/silent-cry-2015-08-26","order":245,"story_date":"2015-08-26","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":115,"quote":"Zendikar would fight back.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=Zendikar%20would%20fight%20back.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Silent Cry","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=Zendikar%20would%20fight%20back.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Silent Cry\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"silent-cry-2015-08-26-e7","summary":"Nissa and Ashaya are struck by terrible pain as the connection to Zendikar is torn away, and Ashaya collapses and shatters.","participants":["nissa-revane","ashaya","zendikar"],"location":"the-vastwood-forest","importance":"major","page":"stories/silent-cry-2015-08-26","order":245,"story_date":"2015-08-26","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":146,"quote":"Nissa watched as Ashaya's branches snapped and shattered on the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=Nissa%20watched%20as%20Ashaya%27s,shattered%20on%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Silent Cry","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-08-26","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/silent-cry-2015-08-26#:~:text=Nissa%20watched%20as%20Ashaya%27s,shattered%20on%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Silent Cry\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 26 Aug 2015."}},{"id":"nissas-quest-2015-09-23-e0","summary":